# =====================================================================
# Release V065 -- Chair utilisation: strip diary BLOCK time from both sides
# =====================================================================
# No-patient "block" appointments (NOT WORKING/Lunch/Annual Leave/Bank Holiday/
# Training/Meeting/Medical) were ~76% of Appointment_Hours and also left worked
# hours inflated. Fix in the daily aggregate:
#  (1) appointment spine now requires fk_Patient>0 so blocks/placeholders don't
#      count as appointments (also shifts DNA/exam/cancellation denominators -- intended);
#  (2) Worked_Hours = diary Available_Clinical_Mins MINUS on-day block minutes,
#      floored at 0 (interim explicit reason list -> reason-map Block category later).
# Corrected chair utilisation ~74% on dev T100.
#
# Rebuild Gold.Aggregate_Site_Patient_Practitioner_Daily (+ Fact_Metric_Actuals + model).
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V065__chair_util_blocks.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Aggregate_Site_Patient_Practitioner_Daily.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
